{"story":{"id":"event-first-contact-285","title":{"zh":"审讯完毕","en":"Interrogations Complete"},"category":"society","kind":"event","image":"art/0a935bdb597ba6426b45.webp","start":"first_contact.285","chapters":1,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"我们结束了对此前抓获的[This.ContactCountry.GetName]外星人的研究。最初这些人质不太愿意与我们合作，但随着时间推移他们在无意中不断地给了我们有关他们语言的线索，一直到我们能够与他们进行基础的语言交流。从那时起，我们就能迅速拼凑有关他们的细节，一旦有一位或是更多的人质愿意合作，我们就能进入他们的电脑系统。\n\n得益于从他们身上收集到的信息，我们能够确认他们来自[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]，并就其活动和军事实力收集到了相当多的情报。","en":"We have concluded our study of the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] aliens we recently captured. The hostages were initially unwilling to cooperate with us, but over time they inadvertently gave us clues to their language, until we were able to communicate with t"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"first_contact.285","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"首次接触","en":"First contact"}]},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact.285","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"审讯完毕","en":"Interrogations Complete"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们结束了对此前抓获的[This.ContactCountry.GetName]外星人的研究。最初这些人质不太愿意与我们合作，但随着时间推移他们在无意中不断地给了我们有关他们语言的线索，一直到我们能够与他们进行基础的语言交流。从那时起，我们就能迅速拼凑有关他们的细节，一旦有一位或是更多的人质愿意合作，我们就能进入他们的电脑系统。\n\n得益于从他们身上收集到的信息，我们能够确认他们来自[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]，并就其活动和军事实力收集到了相当多的情报。","en":"We have concluded our study of the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] aliens we recently captured. The hostages were initially unwilling to cooperate with us, but over time they inadvertently gave us clues to their language, until we were able to communicate with them on a basic level. From that point, we were rapidly able to piece together further details about them, eventually gaining access to their computer systems once one of the more cooperative hostages cracked.\n\nThanks to the information we have gleaned from them, we are able to identify them as the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName] and have amassed considerable intelligence on their activities and capabilities."},{"zh":"我们结束了对此前抓获的[This.ContactCountry.GetName]外星人的研究。这些人质显然意志薄弱，没什么阻止我们对其调查的想法。事实上，他们十分配合。我们很快就能翻译他们的语言并进入对方的电脑系统。\n\n因此，我们得以确定他们来自[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]，并就其活动和军事实力收集到了相当多的情报。","en":"We have concluded our study of the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] aliens we recently captured. The hostages were remarkably weak-willed and showed no particular desire to keep us from finding out about them; indeed, they proved extremely cooperative. We were soon able to translate their language and access their computer systems.\n\nAs a result, we have been able to identify them as the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName] and have amassed considerable intelligence on their activities and capabilities."},{"zh":"我们结束了对此前抓获的[This.ContactCountry.GetName]外星人的研究。这些人质表现得极其不愿意配合我们，甚至我们审讯者使用了以往最具有说服力的方法也无济于事。然而，随着时间的推移，他们在无意中不断地泄露出有关他们语言的各种线索，最终使得我们有能力与他们开展基础性的交流。从那时起，我们就可以迅速拼凑出有关他们的细节，此外骇入对方部分基础电脑系统的行动也取得了进展。尽管如此，我们还是怀疑他们对我方隐瞒了大量细节。\n\n得益于我们从他们身上获取的信息，我们得以确定他们来自于[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]，并就其活动和军事力量获取了大量情报。","en":"We have concluded our study of the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] aliens we recently captured. The hostages proved remarkably unwilling to cooperate with us, resisting even the most persuasive methods of our interrogators. However, over time, they inadvertently gave us clues to their language, eventually allowing us to communicate with them on a basic level. From that point, we were rapidly able to piece together further details about them - as well as gain access to some of their basic computer systems - although we suspect that they were able to keep many details back.\n\nThanks to the information we were able to glean from them, we are able to identify them as the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName] and have amassed considerable intelligence on their activities and capabilities."},{"zh":"我们结束了对于此前我们截获的[This.ContactCountry.GetName]机械无人机的调查行动。我们一切断它们与上级人工智能的链接之后，这些无人机就失去了代理，并且被发现几乎完全失去了作用，因为其功能已经迅速退化。\n\n幸运的是，我们想办法破解了他们的电脑系统的秘钥，[This.Owner.GetLinguists]马上就能翻译他们用来通讯的信号。现在，我们已经能够确认[This.ContactCountry.GetName]是[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]，。我们现在积累了大量有关他们活动和能力的情报。","en":"We have concluded our study of the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] machines we recently captured. Once cut off from their parent AI, the drones lacked agency, and we were able to find out little of use from them as their functionality rapidly degraded.\n\nFortunately, we were able to crack the codes to their computer systems, and our [This.Owner.GetLinguists] were soon able to translate the signals they use for communication. As a result, we can now identify the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] as the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName] and have amassed considerable intelligence on their activities and capabilities."},{"zh":"我们结束了对于此前捕获的[This.ContactCountry.GetName]外星人的研究。看上去它们确实是由蜂巢思维所链接起来的，单独的子个体是缺少自我意识和代理权的。将其从主体意识剥离后，这些子个体似乎漫无目的，然后一个接一个地死去。除了将其作为生物标本外也没什么其他地作用了。\n\n幸运的是，我们想办法破解了他们的电脑系统的秘钥，[This.Owner.GetLinguists]马上就能翻译他们用来通讯的信号。现在，我们已经能够确认[This.ContactCountry.GetName]是[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]，。我们现在积累了大量有关他们活动和能力的情报。","en":"We have concluded our study of the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] aliens we recently captured. It would appear that they are indeed organized as a hive mind, with individual drones lacking autonomy or agency. Cut off from the body, the drones seemed aimless and died off one by one, not yielding much in the way of useful information except as unwitting biological specimens.\n\nFortunately, we were able to crack the codes to their computer systems, and our [This.Owner.GetLinguists] were soon able to translate the signals they use for communication. As a result, we can now identify the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] as the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName] and have amassed considerable intelligence on their activities and capabilities."},{"zh":"我们已经完成了对近期捕获的[This.ContactCountry.GetName]外星生物的研究。这些为数众多的生命体以某种蜂巢思维的方式组织起来，但并没有一个中央的管理实体。相反，这些几乎不具备智慧的个体似乎与它们的整个生物群落形成了一种共生格式塔结构。 由于彼此隔绝且与母星失去联系，这些共生体退化至原始状态并迅速消亡。除了作为解剖对象外，它们没有为我们提供多少有用的信息。\n\n幸运的是，我们想办法破解了他们的电脑系统的秘钥，[This.Owner.GetLinguists]马上就能翻译他们用来通讯的信号。现在，我们已经能够确认[This.ContactCountry.GetName]是[This.ContactCountry.GetRealName]，。我们现在积累了大量有关他们活动和能力的情报。","en":"We have concluded our study of the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] aliens we recently captured. This myriad assortment of lifeforms are organized as a sort of hive mind, albeit without a central, governing entity. Instead these barely-sapient individuals seem to form a mutualistic gestalt with their entire biome. Since being isolated from each other as well as their homeworld, these symbionts reverted to a primal state and perished fairly rapidly. They have yielded little useful information to us, save as subjects for autopsy.\n\nFortunately, we were able to crack the codes to their computer systems, and our [This.Owner.GetLinguists] were soon able to translate the signals they use for communication. As a result, we can now identify the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] as the [This.ContactCountry.GetRealName] and have amassed considerable intelligence on their activities and capabilities."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/0a935bdb597ba6426b45.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"EXCELLENT","label":{"zh":"棒极了。","en":"Excellent."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"galactic_features.387","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c11999","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"contact_country","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"has_first_contact_flag","arg":"hostile_first_contact_attempted","scope":"","value":true}]],[[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"tiyanki_graveyard_survey","path":"","value":true}]]],"source":"common/scripted_effects/first_contact_effects.txt:178","story":"event-galactic-features-387"},{"target":"cara.1020","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c11999","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"defaul